- DATA PREPERATION
Each month is compared against its own product's historical average, so products of very different price and size can be analyzed fairly. Seven columns were added in Power Query:

  Column	               Purpose
| product_avg_price	   | Historical product price benchmark
| product_avg_qty	     | Historical sales volume benchmark
| price_index	         | Relative price level 
| qty_index	           | Relative sales volume 
| price_band	         | Groups monthly prices into five bands, from more than 10% below to more than 10% above normal
| competitor_avg_price | Competitor pricing benchmark
| price_gap_pct	       | Our price difference from competitors


